{"3834750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nitro X Necros", "steam_appid": 3834750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4769720], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world ended, but that doesn't mean fun has to end too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro &amp; Necros is a casual roguelite where you can choose from a variety of upgrades to become even more powerful as you run over hordes of zombies! The main focus is surviving and building the ultimate mortal machine, wrecking everything that moves in the blink of an eye!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Destroy crowds of zombies and survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/f4fe4604816b4be49bc2eb5160f41746.poster.avif?t=1785946136\" width=940 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/f4fe4604816b4be49bc2eb5160f41746.webm?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/f4fe4604816b4be49bc2eb5160f41746.mp4?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos is your ally! Break the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose between different upgrades every time you level up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/0408762947eed7e73c5e730eb3f76ebe.poster.avif?t=1785946136\" width=940 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/0408762947eed7e73c5e730eb3f76ebe.webm?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/0408762947eed7e73c5e730eb3f76ebe.mp4?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro &amp; Necros is a simple game with deep and complex choices that can lead you into different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Unlock different characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/ca3f4624079e06296eaf39d137815282.poster.avif?t=1785946136\" width=940 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/ca3f4624079e06296eaf39d137815282.webm?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/ca3f4624079e06296eaf39d137815282.mp4?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each character has unique base stats and a special hability that will change completely how you play the game! <br><strong> </strong><br>The game also has permanent upgrades that you can unlock as long as you collect the bills!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world ended, but that doesn't mean fun has to end too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro &amp; Necros is a casual roguelite where you can choose from a variety of upgrades to become even more powerful as you run over hordes of zombies! The main focus is surviving and building the ultimate mortal machine, wrecking everything that moves in the blink of an eye!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Destroy crowds of zombies and survive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/f4fe4604816b4be49bc2eb5160f41746.poster.avif?t=1785946136\" width=940 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/f4fe4604816b4be49bc2eb5160f41746.webm?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/f4fe4604816b4be49bc2eb5160f41746.mp4?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos is your ally! Break the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose between different upgrades every time you level up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/0408762947eed7e73c5e730eb3f76ebe.poster.avif?t=1785946136\" width=940 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/0408762947eed7e73c5e730eb3f76ebe.webm?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/0408762947eed7e73c5e730eb3f76ebe.mp4?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitro &amp; Necros is a simple game with deep and complex choices that can lead you into different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Unlock different characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/ca3f4624079e06296eaf39d137815282.poster.avif?t=1785946136\" width=940 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/ca3f4624079e06296eaf39d137815282.webm?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/extras/ca3f4624079e06296eaf39d137815282.mp4?t=1785946136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each character has unique base stats and a special hability that will change completely how you play the game! <br><strong> </strong><br>The game also has permanent upgrades that you can unlock as long as you collect the bills!</p>", "short_description": "Destroy hordes of zombies with your powerful turrets! Nitro &amp; Necros is a Roguelite with tons of upgrades to make your car more and more powerful. You will drive over all kinds of zombies, shoot them up with your turrets and level up to select the best upgrades to survive this madness!", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/cbf73521876fa22c4b4aaaed6be7d43fe6058eca/header.jpg?t=1785946136", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/e3fbd4367b892b83f4ab43452837ba7490878552/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785946136", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834750/e3fbd4367b892b83f4ab43452837ba7490878552/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785946136", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> </li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended: